# The Quota, vertical slice: day 41 of the famine winter, Edrin's Upper Town (era 2). Story lead,
# 2026-10-21. Private. Design: design/QUOTA-DESIGN.md and design/quota/ (07-PRODUCTION, the slice).
# Root file. The Gullet acts are untouched (07-PRODUCTION decision 5 is open); this act stands beside
# them. Its ruleset is its own (q_rules.lwd, 2026-10-21): the compartments and voices under the same
# ids, two sheets, the plain's day, and no creation screen; it borrows nothing from the Gullet acts. Two classes: the Inspector line (Ned Furrowe) and the Militia line (Will
# Brack). Slurs are the invented ones only, until decision 2.
@meta
title: The Quota. The slice
title-screen: The Prayer for the Water
title-sub: The famine winter in Edrin's Upper Town.
title-area: q.tower
format: lwd/1
act: 1
night: 1
start: e1.start
clock: 05:50
end-clock: 23:59
community-day: 41
era: 2
class-var: q_class
world-keep: q_class q_figure q_cart q_door
world-line: said.ned_report_* said.will_report_*
meters: off
numbers: off
journal: off
hud: clock weather place
hud-day: Day {day} of the winter
hud-weather: frost snow wind
hud-held: var.era == 1 | var.era == 3 | var.era == 4 | var.era == 5
hud-held-weather: harvest
name-face: grotesk
player-figure: q_class inspector=ned militia=will
community.export: 0
community.blacklist: 0
community.silenced.hesh_hoard: 0
player-household: q_class inspector=furrowe militia=brack
